/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1931090/extras/c30eba6f5c2d2ae52ee86a36e4c0687e.webm?t=1652712502\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1931090/extras/c30eba6f5c2d2ae52ee86a36e4c0687e.mp4?t=1652712502\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>\u00b7Levels are randomly generated with different terrains and different MOBs.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1931090/extras/9f2073631d1c7b43ca69ca598f0cdb20.avif?t=1652712502\" /></div><br><br>\u00b7This game has no guidance, dialogue, and story. Good luck.",
